rooms_desc ({"You are standing in Soozie's living room.  As you look around at the decor, afeeling of warmth and relaxation overcomes you.  There is a black plush velvetsofa in the center of the room, with two matching, overstuffed La-Z-Boysarranged next to it.  The main thing you notice about this room is the HUGEblack marble fireplace that stands opposite the couch and chairs.  It's bigenought for you to walk into (Soozie uses it to roast orcs in!)!!  You feelthat if there were ever a fire in there, it would be HOT.  You see two lampsstanding in opposite corners of the room, giving it a soft, warm, homey glow.Covering the floor is the thickest black shag carpet you've ever seen.  Asyou walk across it, you get the feeling that your feet are inches off the ground.  The paintings depict Native American Spirits and Beliefs.  You thinkthat if you ever laid down to sleep here, you would never wake up...","This is Soozie's kitchen.  She keeps it locked because Calvyn tends to comeover and help himself to her food.  There is black-and-white hound's toothtiling on the floor that is polished to a shine.  Off to the left is a blacksteel door that leads to her walk-in refrigerator and freezer.  To your right is a counter with cupboards above and beneath it, which extends to thewall opposite you.  The counter contains a double stainless steel sink justbelow a window.  And a few framed pictures are hung on the walls.  On thefloor, next to the walk-in, are two of the biggest \"doggie\" bowls you haveever seen!!  One is empty, though it looks as if it has just been eaten out of,and the other is filled with water that would go up to your knees if you stood in it.  You are not sure if you would like to meet the owner of these bowls....","This is Soozie's personal bar.  Low lighting here gives a subdued, mellowatmosphere.  Padded leather bar stools stand along the bar, which extendsalong the wntire south and east walls.  Shelves also run the same lengthbehind the bar.  The shelves are packed with bottles of liquor found both here in HM and in RL.  Above the bar are racks stuffed with mugs andglasses for drinking.  Above the shelving on the east wall is a 17'TV screen that will show any program ever broadcast.  There are speakersin every corner of the room.  A pool table and pinball machines are srrangedin the centre of the room.  The north wall holds five old Wurlitzer Jukeboxesthat will play any song you wish to hear.  The rest of the space on that wallis taken up by many beer taps (the refrigerator kind).  There are mostly Budweiser taps, but you can yfind your favorite \"brewski\" here as well.  Several of the bottles on the shelves have notes attached to them... You lookaround and silently wish this was a room in your house....","As you enter this room...you wonder if it is really a room!!  There is a a carpet of the thickest grass covering the floor, and trees line the east andwest walls.  This room is like a tree-lined walkway, though you can seethe sky above.  Birds are singing and every once in awhile, you thinkyou get a glimpse of some of the mythical creatures that you've heard Soozieprotects and cares for.  It is springtime all year here, and the flowersare always in bloom.  A stream runs along your left, and bushes are to your right.  Feel free to look around and enjoy nature!","This is Calvyn and Soozie's bedroom.  Obviously this is the largest roomin the house.  There is a Wizard-sized (that's even bigger than King-sized)four poster canopy bed decorated in black and dark red satin linens.  In thecorner of the room there is a large wardrobe.  There are matching dressers and night tables carved from mahogany and bone.  There are framed pictures onthe night tables.  There is a mirror on one of the dressers and a crystalpyramid on the other.  You notice in another corner stands a black jacuzzi.The ambiance of this room is one of quietude and tranquility.  A thick, darkred carpet, much like the one in the living room, covers the floor in thisroom.  You see portraits of Calvyn and Soozie's families on the walls.This room reminds you of how much Calvyn and Soozie love each otherand how strong their love is.",0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"You have entered Soozie's humble home....","This is a very sacred room.....","The BAR.......","The Garden Room","The MASTER Bedroom",0,0,0,0,0,})
